WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.900
For decades, we have measured luxury by what a home contains.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.400
But your brain doesn't experience a brand.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.000
It experiences space.

4
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:15.500
Light. Air. Nature. Sound. Memory. Movement. Proportion.

5
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.000
Every space is already speaking to us.

6
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.200
The question is…

7
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.200
…has anyone designed what it is saying?

8
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Seven human experiences.

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Forty-nine architectural explorations.

10
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.000
Hyderabad…

11
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.000
…perhaps it's time we experienced architecture differently.
